			"notes": "# Changes\n- Ported [Controlify](https://github.com/isXander/Controlify/releases) v2.5.2 to support MC v26.2-26.2.X? (Fabric/Neoforge) to mitigate splitscreen controller issues https://github.com/isXander/Controlify/issues/853\n  - If you are using a version lower than MC v26.1 just download the official v2.5.2 binaries from https://modrinth.com/mod/controlify/versions\n  - *You may need to disable [Remove Reloading Screen](https://modrinth.com/mod/rrls) as it was broken with this version previously*\n- Pre-Compiled binaries are below\n\n\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]  \n> You must delete your v3.0.1 controlify configs: `.minecraft\\config\\controlify.json` + `.minecraft\\controlify-natives`\n> If you don't the game may crash due to [incompatibility issues](https://github.com/isXander/Controlify/pull/782)\n<img width=\"853\" height=\"511\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e354c552-f862-49f3-a1f8-8ac43daa33e2\" />"
